    "Fastmail App Passwords" : {
      "comment" : "Fastmail quick link button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fastmail App 密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Gmail (@gmail.com / Google Workspace) requires:\n1. Enable IMAP at mail.google.com → Settings ⚙ → See all settings → Forwarding and POP/IMAP → IMAP access: Enable\n2. Enable 2-Step Verification at myaccount.google.com → Security\n3. Create App Password at myaccount.google.com/apppasswords (select 'Mail')\n4. Paste the 16-char App Password here, NOT your Gmail login password\n\nGoogle Workspace: your admin may have disabled IMAP org-wide. Ask them to enable it in Admin Console." : {
      "comment" : "Gmail multi-step setup hint (v1.8.1).",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gmail(@gmail.com / Google Workspace)需要:\n1. 在 mail.google.com → 设置 ⚙ → 查看所有设置 → 转发和 POP/IMAP → 启用 IMAP\n2. 在 myaccount.google.com → 安全 中开启两步验证\n3. 在 myaccount.google.com/apppasswords 创建 App 密码(选择「邮件」)\n4. 把 16 位 App 密码粘贴到这里,不要填 Gmail 登录密码\n\nGoogle Workspace:管理员可能在全组织范围内禁用了 IMAP,请让他们在管理控制台中启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud (@icloud.com / @me.com / @mac.com) requires:\n1. Enable 2-Factor Authentication at appleid.apple.com → Sign-In and Security\n2. Generate App-Specific Password under Sign-In and Security → App-Specific Passwords\n3. Use the app-specific password here, NOT your Apple ID password" : {
      "comment" : "iCloud multi-step setup hint.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloud(@icloud.com / @me.com / @mac.com)需要:\n1. 在 appleid.apple.com → 登录与安全 中开启双重认证\n2. 在 登录与安全 → App 专用密码 中生成 App 专用密码\n3. 在这里填 App 专用密码,不要填 Apple ID 密码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Outlook personal accounts (@outlook.com / @hotmail.com / @live.com):\n1. Enable 2-Step Verification at account.live.com → Security\n2. Create App Password under Security → Advanced security options\n3. Use the 16-char App Password here, NOT your account password\n\nSome legacy accounts have IMAP disabled by default — enable in Outlook.com Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Outlook multi-step setup hint (v1.8.0).",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Outlook 个人账户(@outlook.com / @hotmail.com / @live.com):\n1. 在 account.live.com → 安全 中开启两步验证\n2. 在 安全 → 高级安全选项 中创建 App 密码\n3. 在这里填 16 位 App 密码,不要填账号登录密码\n\n部分老账户默认关闭 IMAP —— 请在 Outlook.com 设置中启用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yahoo:\n1. Sign in at login.yahoo.com → Account Security\n2. Generate App Password (Mail) — distinct from your account password\n3. Use the generated App Password here, NOT your Yahoo login password\n\nYahoo aggressively expires App Passwords — regenerate if auth fails after a long gap." : {
      "comment" : "Yahoo multi-step setup hint.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Yahoo:\n1. 登录 login.yahoo.com → 账户安全\n2. 生成 App 密码(邮件)—— 与账号登录密码不同\n3. 在这里填生成的 App 密码,不要填 Yahoo 登录密码\n\nYahoo 会较快让 App 密码过期 —— 长时间未用后登录失败请重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fastmail:\n1. Settings → Privacy & Security → App passwords → New app password\n2. Give it 'Mail (IMAP)' access\n3. Use the generated app password here, NOT your account password" : {
      "comment" : "Fastmail multi-step setup hint.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fastmail:\n1. 设置 → 隐私与安全 → App 密码 → 新建 App 密码\n2. 赋予它「Mail (IMAP)」访问权限\n3. 在这里填生成的 App 密码,不要填账号登录密码"
          }
        }
      }
